            420
          ],
          "type": "list",
          "text": " Economic and Social Viability  Field Project Status and Feasibility  Geological Knowledge",
          "confidence": 0.9996291539248299
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            125,
            447,
            872,
            502
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The System of Environmental Economic Accounting (SEEA)-Energy groups the detailed categories of UNFC into three aggregated classes characterizing the commercial recoverability of the resources as follows:",
          "confidence": 0.9999035426548549
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            153,
            508,
            638,
            563
          ],
          "type": "list",
          "text": " Class A : Commercially recoverable resources.  Class B : Potentially commercially recoverable resources.  Class C : Non-commercial and other known deposits.",
          "confidence": 0.9997602262917686
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            125,
